{{PIE root|de|bʰuH}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|būwen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|būan}}, from {{inh|goh|gem-pro|*būaną}}, whence also {{cog|ang|būan}}, {{cog|non|búa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈbaʊ̯ən]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-bauen.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-bauen.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|baut|baute|gebaut}}

# to [[build]]; to [[construct]]
